  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Access to Inclusive Justice for Persons with Disabilities project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project wil be implemented in 4 wards of Chiredzi ie wards (4,17 and 23 (old wards), however, one new ward (Ward 8) will be added. This addition will be done in order to increase the projects reach and scope. The project will increase the target to 400 persons with disabilities and 200 vulnerable women. The expected project impact is as follows; At personal level - Women are organised and mobilised to take collective action to affirm the right to food for individuals, households and communities. At social level - Positive shared norms, attitudes and values emerge that affirm women&apos;s meaningful participation, voice and agency.</narrative>
  </description>
